558
00:26:20,580 --> 00:26:22,770
Right here in California.

559
00:26:22,770 --> 00:26:24,117
The state community colleges,

560
00:26:24,117 --> 00:26:26,250
the CSUs are collaborating

561
00:26:26,250 --> 00:26:27,840
with some of the most iconic companies

562
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:31,053
like Google and IBM, Adobe, and Microsoft.

563
00:26:32,499 --> 00:26:37,499
(audience applauds) (upbeat music plays)

564
00:26:41,940 --> 00:26:46,523
- Hi again. (audience applauds and cheers)

