00:27:57,630 --> 00:27:59,430
So Chancellor Lambert mentioned

586
00:27:59,430 --> 00:28:03,570
one year ago we were at De Anza College as we launched

587
00:28:03,570 --> 00:28:07,800
the California Community College's Future Summit.

