604
00:28:58,380 --> 00:29:02,853
while creating and predicting the AI enabled future.

605
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:07,650
So let's start with any state of the system.

606
00:29:07,650 --> 00:29:10,860
By looking at two years ago,

