621
00:29:54,360 --> 00:29:59,360
So that policy would be guided by facts, not headlines.

622
00:29:59,847 --> 00:30:03,060
And AI council with faculty, administrators,

623
00:30:03,060 --> 00:30:04,590
classified staff and students

624
00:30:04,590 --> 00:30:07,980
