626
00:30:10,350 --> 00:30:12,690
And Craig Hayward has been leading

627
00:30:12,690 --> 00:30:14,163
and coordinating that work.

628
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:17,220
In July, 2024,

629
00:30:17,220 --> 00:30:19,680
the board of Governors was presented

630
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:21,630
the humans,

631
00:30:21,630 --> 00:30:24,630
H-U-M-A-N-S,

632
00:30:24,630 --> 00:30:28,500
framework for responsible AI.

633
00:30:28,500 --> 00:30:32,040
H stands for human-centered Approach,

634
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:34,830
U for universal design,

635
00:30:34,830 --> 00:30:38,400
M for Managed Privacy and Controls.

636
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:41,280
That is to give people the agency

637
00:30:41,280 --> 00:30:45,510
of how their personal data is collected and used.

638
00:30:45,510 --> 00:30:47,220
So going back to the acronym,

639
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:51,150
A stands for Algorithmic Discrimination Protections.

640
00:30:51,150 --> 00:30:54,330
And thank you Safiya Noble for that.

641
00:30:54,330 --> 00:30:56,820
N for notice and explanation.

642
00:30:56,820 --> 00:30:59,190
And this provides sufficient notification

643
00:30:59,190 --> 00:31:02,430
about the use of automated systems,

644
00:31:02,430 --> 00:31:05,700
and S for safety and security.

645
00:31:05,700 --> 00:31:08,340
Talk about responsible AI use, right?

646
00:31:08,340 --> 00:31:09,603
We are leading the way.

647
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:13,080
If the acronym sounds like it was invented

648
00:31:13,080 --> 00:31:15,750
by people who love acronyms.

649
00:31:15,750 --> 00:31:19,140
It was. (audience laughs)

650
00:31:19,140 --> 00:31:20,580
My hope, dear colleagues,

651
00:31:20,580 --> 00:31:24,240
is that every district similar to the Board of Governors,

652
00:31:24,240 --> 00:31:26,670
every district's board of trustees

653
00:31:26,670 --> 00:31:31,290
