656
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:38,550
the governing board sort of putting out a statement,

657
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,753
a bold statement.

658
00:31:40,710 --> 00:31:43,950
Also, in July, 2024,

659
00:31:43,950 --> 00:31:45,510
the board authorized

