802
00:38:50,249 --> 00:38:53,249
(audience applauds)

803
00:38:55,260 --> 00:38:57,630
So category two is workforce development.

804
00:38:57,630 --> 00:39:00,660
If you see our vice chancellor, Tony Cordova,

805
00:39:00,660 --> 00:39:02,400
