2461
01:51:25,410 --> 01:51:27,510
So we've had a lot of success

2462
01:51:27,510 --> 01:51:28,770
building predictive analytics

2463
01:51:28,770 --> 01:51:31,230
with institutions and alongside institutions.

2464
01:51:31,230 --> 01:51:33,480
And our bias is that these solutions

2465
01:51:33,480 --> 01:51:35,520
