2469
01:51:41,670 --> 01:51:43,680
Every institution should have these tools

2470
01:51:43,680 --> 01:51:45,180
to be able to make an impact.

2471
01:51:45,180 --> 01:51:48,420
And as we go beyond just predictive analytics,

2472
01:51:48,420 --> 01:51:50,670
we are also looking for partnerships

2473
01:51:50,670 --> 01:51:54,900
on other parts of the AI sphere,

2474
01:51:54,900 --> 01:51:57,060
because we believe it can be additive

2475
01:51:57,060 --> 01:52:00,420
for impact in places like building up your data trust.

2476
01:52:00,420 --> 01:52:02,340
Yes, predictive analytics is great,

2477
