but if you don't trust the data

2478
01:52:03,990 --> 01:52:05,580
that is behind those analytics,

2479
01:52:05,580 --> 01:52:08,970
you will never actually use those predictive models.

2480
01:52:08,970 --> 01:52:12,810
AI tools can help with the data quality assessments,

2481
01:52:12,810 --> 01:52:15,480
it can help build the connections between data sets

2482
01:52:15,480 --> 01:52:17,740
to be sure that you have the right data out

2483
01:52:18,690 --> 01:52:21,630
and it can be used to make sense of the information

2484
01:52:21,630 --> 01:52:22,980
that you have in your system.

2485
01:52:22,980 --> 01:52:25,110
Yes, predictive analytics are great.

2486
01:52:25,110 --> 01:52:28,020
Where we're going now from that story I just told

2487
01:52:28,020 --> 01:52:29,820
about being able to predict the students

2488
01:52:29,820 --> 01:52:31,050
